<title>DENMARK: Carlsberg slumps on H1 figures.</title>
<headline>Carlsberg slumps on H1 figures.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish brewer Carlsberg slumped by three percent on Wednesday morning on a market disappointed by its first half 1996/97 results.</p>
<p>At 1010 GMT the share was down 12 crowns from Tuesday's close, to 376.00 crowns.</p>
<p>The company on Tuesday reported a year-on-year rise in pre-tax profits but analysts said that the figure was bolstered by financial items and noted that the operating result was below expectations. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
